  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879968",
      "title": "Filtering Requests for the Active Coach",
      "lectureOrder": 252,
      "videoOrder": 224,
      "sourceHash": "7c88e9ebd6b8470969322dac8af61d2323f119e9e349410a62d095bdc3a04938",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.289,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So in order to make sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "that we only see requests that are for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 9.605,
          "en": "So, for this userId in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.605,
          "end": 12.57,
          "en": "we can go to our requests getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.57,
          "end": 15.949,
          "en": "and here on the requests, which we're,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.949,
          "end": 17.15,
          "en": "fetching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.15,
          "end": 20.01,
          "en": "I no longer wanna get all requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.01,
          "end": 21.49,
          "en": "but instead I wanna filter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.49,
          "end": 26.129,
          "en": "for requests that have our ID as a coachId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.129,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "So therefore we can utilize the fact that in a getter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 32.66,
          "en": "we can take more than just one argument, besides the state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.66,
          "end": 34.64,
          "en": "we can get access to our getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.64,
          "end": 38.89,
          "en": "then also to the root state, and to root getters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.89,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "And the root getters are what I need here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 46.52,
          "en": "because the userId is part of the root store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.52,
          "end": 49.93,
          "en": "And there we have a userId getter already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.93,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "That's the getter which will be useful now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "Here we get the coachId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 58.837,
          "en": "by reaching out to rootGetters.userId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.04,
          "end": 64.07,
          "en": "that's the getter name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.07,
          "end": 67.05,
          "en": "And then here, we wanna filter the requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.05,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "which we got, and go through all the requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 73.08,
          "en": "and check if the request coachId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.08,
          "end": 77.02,
          "en": "is equal to the coachId we extracted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.02,
          "end": 79.97,
          "en": "And only these requests are then the requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.97,
          "end": 81.383,
          "en": "that are returned here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.76,
          "end": 85.86,
          "en": "This also means that we should change hasRequests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.86,
          "end": 90.16,
          "en": "and not check all requests in our state, but instead,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.16,
          "end": 91.7,
          "en": "simply use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.7,
          "end": 93.86,
          "en": "our, requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.86,
          "end": 95.07,
          "en": "getter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 98.4,
          "en": "by reaching out to getters.requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.4,
          "end": 101.12,
          "en": "so that we check the filtered requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.12,
          "end": 102.713,
          "en": "and not all requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.64,
          "end": 107.05,
          "en": "Now as before I'll replace the unused arguments with,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.05,
          "end": 108.583,
          "en": "underscores here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.75999999999999,
          "end": 111.37,
          "en": "but now we should have a set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.37,
          "end": 114.5,
          "en": "where we really only see the, requests made to us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.5,
          "end": 115.363,
          "en": "as a coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.21000000000001,
          "end": 119.24000000000001,
          "en": "So if you save this, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.24000000000001,
          "end": 121.91,
          "en": "and I send the request to the first coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.91,
          "end": 123.383,
          "en": "which is not us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.46,
          "end": 128.45,
          "en": "we don't see this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.45,
          "end": 131.163,
          "en": "If I now register as a coach though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.5,
          "end": 135.683,
          "en": "I am a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.02,
          "end": 140.37,
          "en": "and I then send a message to me,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.37,
          "end": 142.5,
          "en": "which of course doesn't make too much sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.353,
          "en": "but for the moment, that's the only way we can do it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.63,
          "end": 151.27,
          "en": "If I send this, we should now see that request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.27,
          "end": 153.87,
          "en": "And we don't,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 156.17000000000002,
          "en": "and the error actually is quite subtle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.17000000000002,
          "end": 160.07999999999998,
          "en": "and a bit hard to spot, or actually it's easy to spot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.07999999999998,
          "end": 162.913,
          "en": "as soon as you console log,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.18,
          "end": 166.62,
          "en": "all requests, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 168.18,
          "en": "to see what's inside there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.18,
          "end": 171.02,
          "en": "If you do that, you'll notice one important thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.02,
          "end": 172.603,
          "en": "If you contact a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.73,
          "end": 181.94,
          "en": "and we then inspect the logged getter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.94,
          "end": 185.08,
          "en": "we see that the coachId is undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.08,
          "end": 186.96,
          "en": "And that's the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 189.61,
          "en": "That of course ensures that we're not able to filter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.51,
          "end": 193.37,
          "en": "Now it's undefined because in contact coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.37,
          "end": 195.2,
          "en": "where I set to coachId,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.2,
          "end": 199.474,
          "en": "where I get it from the route, I access this routeId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.474,
          "end": 204.07,
          "en": "Well that's incorrect, this should be this route.parans.id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.07,
          "end": 206.453,
          "en": "That's the correct way of getting access here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.21,
          "end": 211.69,
          "en": "So now with that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.69,
          "end": 216.69,
          "en": "if I go back, and I send a message here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.8,
          "end": 218.68,
          "en": "to the first coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.68,
          "end": 220.563,
          "en": "This is a test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.77,
          "end": 225.64,
          "en": "it still doesn't show up here under requests as it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.64,
          "end": 228.67000000000002,
          "en": "But if we now register as a coach, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.67000000000002,
          "end": 231.69299999999998,
          "en": "and soon we won't have to do this over and over again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.7,
          "end": 234.55,
          "en": "Soon we're going to add a backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.55,
          "end": 236.95,
          "en": "and then the data will be stored permanently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.95,
          "end": 239.12,
          "en": "But for the moment we have to register,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.12,
          "end": 241.893,
          "en": "and if I now sent myself a message here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.45,
          "end": 245.653,
          "en": "This is a test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.59,
          "end": 250.61,
          "en": "Now, we do see this message, and only this message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.61,
          "end": 253.61,
          "en": "here under requests received.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 253.61,
          "end": 256.45,
          "en": "So now that filtering part is also working,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 256.45,
          "end": 261.45,
          "en": "and with that indeed, the entire app is kind of finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.65,
          "end": 264.387,
          "en": "but of course only in this dummy (mumbles).",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.41,
          "end": 267.68,
          "en": "One important thing is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 267.68,
          "end": 271.97,
          "en": "And that's a real backend where we store our coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 271.97,
          "end": 274.77,
          "en": "and where we store our requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 278.02,
          "en": "And where we then of course also fetch the data from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.02,
          "end": 280.911,
          "en": "So that is what I wanna work on together with you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 280.911,
          "end": 282.703,
          "en": "in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
